codex
I found and isolated the shell problem: this runner exposes `/proc` from a different PID namespace, while Lean 4.22 resolves itself through `/proc/<getpid()>/exe`; that path is absent even though `/proc/self/exe` is valid. A narrowly scoped compatibility shim redirects only that lookup. With it, the pinned Lean reports the expected commit and a clean build succeeds. I’m preserving the failed preflight and rerunning the trusted checker with this environment-only correction.
